  "notes": [
    "Measurements can be read with FC04 (input) or FC03 (holding): both return the same values.",
    "32-bit values are sent low word first.",
    "The same measurements are also available grouped by phase from 0x00FE to 0x017E; this map uses the table grouped by variable type.",
    "The RS-485 EM24-DIN models use a different protocol document and are not covered here."
  ],
